Description: avcodec/vulkan: write stereo frame packing with the selected units
 .
 Add default-on frame_packing to the existing units option. Use CBS in the
 encoder's extra-header path and clear HEVC non-packed constraints when
 initial decoded side data establishes the layout.
 .
 RTX 3060 tests cover all supported packings and eye orders, independent
 NAL parsing, trace_headers and FFmpeg/mpv decoding. Temporal B-frames,
 late-layout refusal and tiled geometry controls pass. Unmarked output is
 byte-identical to the unpatched encoder.
 .
 Assisted-by: gpt-6-astra via Codex
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other, https://code.ffmpeg.org/danielcamposramos/FFmpeg/commit/ff983fe5bac19a357d85fd6e7ffac6603e1fbd97
Forwarded: no
